# yaw_hold.expect — heading-hold gate under a standing yaw disturbance.
# G1 state machine + G3 bounded heading/attitude/altitude + G4 actuator health.
#
# Timeline (absolute): A disarmed 0-4, B ARM 4-5, C take-off 5-7, D ALT_HOLD 7-11,
# E fault@11 (M1 at 80%), F hands-off hover under fault 11-19, G restore@19,
# H recover 19-21, I-K disarm 21-22.
#
# THE gate is yaw_band over the fault window: measured 0.60° with the hold
# (kp=3, returns to target) vs 3.06° AND MONOTONICALLY WALKING with the hold
# disabled (attitude.yawhold.kp=0 control run) — the 1.5° bound
# separates the two by ~2.5× in both directions.
#
# yaw_hold.expect — 定在ヨー外乱下のヘディングホールド判定。本命は故障窓の
# yaw_band: ホールド有り実測 0.60°（目標へ戻る）に対し、無効化対照実験
# （attitude.yawhold.kp=0）では 3.06° かつ単調に流れ続ける。1.5° の境界は両側に
# 約 2.5 倍の判別幅を持つ。
#
# XFAIL (known issue, tracked): yaw-band degradation under the ODE motor
# plant — same root cause as pos_flight/pos_yaw (yaw axis fidelity gap; the ODE
# plant reproduces the fitted anti-torque zero, which a static curve does not have). See docs/architecture/simulation-policy.md backlog #11 (yaw-gate
# 4-parameter fit) / #12 (firmware yaw torque-authority headroom).
# XFAIL（既知課題・追跡中）: ODEモータプラント下での yaw_band 劣化 —
# pos_flight/pos_yaw と同根（ヨー軸忠実度のギャップ。ODE プラントは反トルク零点を再現
# するが、静的曲線にはそれが無い）。simulation-policy.md バックログ#11（ヨー判定の
# 4パラフィット化）/#12（ファームヨートルク権限余裕）参照。
# UPDATE 2026-11-22 (rate.yaw.td default 0.01 -> 0, backlog #12): yaw_band in [11.5,19.0] 1.98 deg -> 1.95 deg and alt_max
# in [7.0,20.5] 1.017 -> 1.016 m: the two failing checks are essentially unchanged by the derivative term, so the xfail
# stays (its reason, a yaw-axis fidelity gap, is not resolved by td = 0).
# 更新 2026-11-22（rate.yaw.td の既定値 0.01 → 0、バックログ #12）: 窓 [11.5,19.0] の yaw_band は 1.98 度 → 1.95 度、窓 [7.0,20.5] の
# alt_max は 1.017 → 1.016 m。不合格の 2 つの判定は微分項でほとんど変わらないので、xfail は残す（理由のヨー軸の忠実度の差は td = 0 では解消しない）。
xfail: yaw-band degradation under the ODE motor plant, same root cause as pos_flight/pos_yaw (yaw-axis fidelity gap, simulation-policy backlog #11/#12)
exit 0
log_contains any "ARM accepted"                       # G1: IDLE_GROUND → ARMED_GROUND
log_contains any "Takeoff complete"                   # G1: TAKEOFF → FLYING
log_contains any "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD"  # G1: hover law engaged
log_contains any "DISARM accepted"                    # G1: clean end of flight
metric yaw_band < 0.02618   in 11.5 19.0  # 1.5 deg  # G3: heading BOUNDED through the fault (the heading-hold gate)
metric tilt_max < 0.1745  in 11.0 19.0  # 10.0 deg  # G3: attitude bounded under the asymmetric fault
metric alt_min   > 0.10  in 11.0 19.0   # G3: the fault dip stays shallow, no touchdown
metric alt_max   < 0.85  in  7.0 20.5   # G3: no balloon through fault entry/recovery
metric duty_max  < 0.96  in 11.0 19.0   # G4: motors keep margin while compensating M1
